an><span>K</span></div><div class=\"absolute right-2.5 top-2.5 text-[#8A8F87]\"><svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\"></path></svg></div></div><button class=\"sm:hidden flex items-center justify-center h-11 w-11 text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle search\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-4\"><button class=\"inline-flex h-8 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-[#212623] bg-[#131615] px-3 text-xs font-sans font-semibold text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:border-[#8FBF3F]/60 transition-all duration-200\"><svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-[#8FBF3F]\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12.24 10.285V14.4h6.887c-.648 2.41-2.519 4.114-6.887 4.114-4.68 0-8.473-3.882-8.473-8.514 0-4.632 3.793-8.515 8.473-8.515 2.502 0 4.263.957 5.372 2.036l3.12-3.12C18.665.926 15.69 0 12.24 0 5.58 0 0 5.58 0 12.24s5.58 12.24 12.24 12.24c6.96 0 11.52-4.896 11.52-11.724 0-.785-.078-1.547-.22-2.22H12.24z\"></path></svg><span>Sign In</span></button><a class=\"inline-flex h-8 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#8FBF3F] px-4 text-xs font-sans font-bold text-[#0D0F0E] hover:bg-[#7ba235] active:bg-[#6c9130] transition-colors duration-[100ms]\" href=\"/submit\">Submit Bot</a></div><button class=\"md:hidden flex items-center justify-center h-11 w-11 text-[#8A8F87] hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col pt-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col flex-1\"><section class=\"relative px-4 py-12 sm:py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center overflow-hidden border-b border-[#1E293B] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0e1627] to-[#0B0F17]\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-72 w-72 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#8FBF3F]/5 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl mb-4 sm:mb-6 min-h-[1.2em]\">Find the exact <span class=\"italic text-[#8FBF3F]\">AI tool</span> by use case<span class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] terminal-cursor select-none ml-1\">▍</span></h1><div class=\"transition-opacity duration-[200ms] opacity-100\"><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6 sm:mb-10 leading-relaxed font-sans\">A curated AI tools directory of platforms and bots categorized by what they do. Search by use case or task to find the exact tool for your workflow.</p><form class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl relative\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center rounded-xl bg-[#131615] border border-[#212623] p-2 focus-within:border-[#8FBF3F] focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-[#8FBF3F] shadow-xl shadow-black/30 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"pl-3 text-slate-500\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\"></path></svg></div><input type=\"text\" aria-label=\"Search directory by task\" placeholder=\"What do you want to do? (e.g., generate an image, summarize a video, write python code)\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent px-4 py-3 text-base text-white placeholder-slate-500 outline-none font-sans font-mono\" value=\"\"/><span class=\"hidden sm:inline-block rounded border border-[#212623] bg-[#0D0F0E] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-slate-500 font-mono select-none mr-3 shrink-0\">Ctrl K</span><button type=\"submit\" class=\"shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-[#8FBF3F] hover:bg-[#7ba235] active:bg-[#6c9130] text-slate-950 font-bold px-6 py-3 transition-colors duration-[100ms] font-sans\">Search</button></div></form></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-900 font-sans\"><div class=\"mb-8 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white\">Why Crawlers?</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2\">An AI tools directory organized by **use case**, not by brand. Monospace style, curated listings, link-out only.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"border border-[#212623] bg-[#131615]/30 rounded-xl p-6\"><div class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] font-mono text-xs uppercase mb-2\">&gt; curated_listings</div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-2 font-serif\">Original Paraphrasing</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">Crawlers checks robots.txt, and paraphrases marketing copy in original words to avoid copyright issues. We index tools by tasks, not by brand logos.</p></div><div class=\"border border-[#212623] bg-[#131615]/30 rounded-xl p-6\"><div class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] font-mono text-xs uppercase mb-2\">&gt; direct_connection</div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-2 font-serif\">No Embeds or Iframes</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">We prioritize user speed and security. No annoying trackers, iframe embeds, or proxies. Click-out only, leading you directly to the original bot.</p></div><div class=\"border border-[#212623] bg-[#131615]/30 rounded-xl p-6\"><div class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] font-mono text-xs uppercase mb-2\">&gt; free_index</div><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-base mb-2 font-serif\">Completely Free</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">No registration or paywall required to browse lists. Save favorites locally and submit new discoveries directly to the queue.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#212623]/80 bg-[#131615]/40 text-center\"><div class=\"space-y-1 transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100\"><div class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-[#8FBF3F]\">1,417</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">ai tools listed</div></div><div class=\"space-y-1 transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100\"><div class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-[#8FBF3F]\">170</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">use-case categories</div></div><div class=\"space-y-1 transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100\"><div class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-[#8FBF3F]\">Direct Link</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">no embeds or iframes</div></div><div class=\"space-y-1 transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100\"><div class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-white/80\">today</div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">last updated</div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-t border-slate-900\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-8 font-sans\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">Browse Directory Index</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1\">Filter by section or search to discover use-case collections</p></div><div class=\"relative w-full md:max-w-xs\"><input type=\"text\" aria-label=\"Search categories\" placeholder=\"Search categories...\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-[#212623] bg-[#0D0F0E] pl-10 pr-8 py-2 text-xs text-white placeholder-slate-500 outline-none focus:border-[#8FBF3F] transition-all font-sans\" value=\"\"/><div class=\"absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-500 pointer-events-none\"><svg class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class=\"sticky top-[64px] z-30 -mx-4 px-4 sm:mx-0 sm:px-0 bg-[#0B0F17]/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-900/60 relative\"><div class=\"flex flex-nowrap items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto py-4 scrollbar-none snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-smooth pr-10\"><button class=\"flex-shrink-0 snap-start px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold font-sans transition-all bg-[#8FBF3F] text-slate-950\">All Categories</button><div class=\"h-5 w-[1px] bg-slate-850 flex-shrink-0 mx-1 snap-start\"></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center py-16 bg-[#131B2E]/20 border border-slate-900 rounded-2xl font-sans\"><svg class=\"mx-auto h-10 w-10 text-slate-600 mb-3\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">No categories found</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Try clearing your filters or typing a different search query</p><button class=\"mt-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Reset Search Filter</button></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-[#212623] bg-[#0A0C0B] py-12 text-[#8A8F87]\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-sm font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-4\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"text-[#8FBF3F]\">&gt;</span><span>crawlers //</span></a><p class=\"text-xs leading-5 max-w-xs text-[#8A8F87] font-sans\">Discover AI bots and command utilities organized strictly by the job to be done. We index, verify, and link directly to external creators.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xs font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-4\">Index Sections</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs font-mono\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/general-reasoning\">/<!-- -->general-reasoning</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/developer-tools\">/<!-- -->developer-tools</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/search-research\">/<!-- -->search-research</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/creative-media\">/<!-- -->creative-media</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#8FBF3F] transition-colors\" href=\"/category/ai-extensions\">/<!-- -->ai-extensions</a></li><li><a class=\"text-[#8FBF3F] hover:underline font-sans font-bold text-xs\" href=\"/\">All Categories →</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xs font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white mb-4\">Compliance</h3><p class=\"text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-[#8A8F87]/80 font-sans\">We built Crawlers to catalog AI tools by use case. Our crawler searches Product Hunt and GitHub feeds, checks robots.txt to respect site policies, and paraphrases marketing copy in our own words to avoid copyright issues. We don&#x27;t embed or iframe external tools — we link you straight to the source.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#212623]/80 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs font-sans\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> crawlers_index. All rights reserved.</p><div c